---
// Safe backward-compatible redirect from /approach to /about (About the Clinic)
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=/about#approach" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="/about" />
    <title>Redirecting to About the Clinic | Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic</title>
    <script is:inline>
      window.location.replace('/about#approach');
    </script>
  </head>
  <body style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif; text-align: center; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; background-color: #FAF8F5; color: #355D48;">
    <div style="max-width: 500px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #E9E4D7; border-radius: 8px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);">
      <h2 style="margin-top: 0; color: #355D48;">Ekansh Homoeopathic Clinic</h2>
      <p style="color: #5A665D; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.5;">Our Clinical Approach has been consolidated into our unified <strong>About the Clinic</strong> page.</p>
      <p style="margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <a href="/about#approach" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #355D48; color: #ffffff; padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9rem;">
          Go to About the Clinic &rarr;
        </a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
